            "For a backyard office with 420 sq. ft. of wall area and 10-inch walls (about 25 cm), you will need roughly 10 to 12 cubic meters of material, and pre-cast hempcrete blocks are definitely the best route to give you maximum speed without the mess of on-site mixing. These blocks arrive fully cured and ready to stack around your structural frame, meaning you skip the weeks of drying time needed for cast-in-situ walls. Plus, hempcrete is 100% legal, non-psychoactive, fire-resistant, and serves as an exceptional non-load-bearing insulation infill regulated under the 2024 IRC Appendix BL. \n\nWould you prefer to lean toward a full 12-inch thickness for maximum thermal performance, or stick with the 10-inch design to preserve a bit more interior floor space?"
